sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant UI as Web Portal
    participant API as WriteOffsController (TO-BE)
    participant Service as WriteOffService (TO-BE)
    participant Store as WriteOffStore (TO-BE)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Note over API,Store: TO-BE components - approval workflow not yet verified in codebase

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. OPEN PENDING WRITE-OFF
    %% ==========================================

    Admin->>+UI: Open Pending Write-Off Request

    UI->>+API: Get Write-Off Details

    API->>+Service: Retrieve Write-Off for Review

    Service->>+Store: Find Write-Off with Items and Attachments

    Store->>+DB: SELECT WriteOff, WriteOffItems and Attachments

    DB-->>Store: Write-Off details or null
    deactivate DB

    Store-->>Service: WriteOffReviewData
    deactivate Store

    Service-->>API: Write-Off details or Not Found
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: Review information
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Admin: Display quantities, reasons and evidence
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. SUBMIT APPROVAL DECISION
    %% ==========================================

    Admin->>+UI: Select Approve or Reject

    UI->>+API: Process Write-Off Decision

    API->>+Service: Process Decision

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. VALIDATE AUTHORIZATION
    %% ==========================================

    Service->>+Service: Validate Administrator Role

    Service-->>Service: Authorization result
    deactivate Service

    alt User is not Administrator

        Note right of Service: Reject operation with Forbidden error

    else Administrator is authorized

        %% ==========================================
        %% 4. BEGIN ATOMIC DECISION PROCESSING
        %% ==========================================

        Service->>+Store: Execute Write-Off Decision Transaction

        Store->>+DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        DB-->>Store: Transaction started
        deactivate DB

        %% ==========================================
        %% 5. LOCK WRITE-OFF REQUEST
        %% ==========================================

        Store->>+DB: SELECT WriteOff FOR UPDATE

        DB-->>Store: Current Write-Off and Status
        deactivate DB

        %% ==========================================
        %% 6. VALIDATE REQUEST STATUS
        %% ==========================================

        alt Write-Off does not exist

            Store->>+DB: ROLLBACK
            DB-->>Store: Transaction rolled back
            deactivate DB

            Note right of Store: Return Not Found

        else Write-Off already Approved and same decision

            Store->>+DB: ROLLBACK
            DB-->>Store: Transaction closed
            deactivate DB

            Note right of Store: Return existing approval without stock deduction

        else Write-Off is not Pending

            Store->>+DB: ROLLBACK
            DB-->>Store: Transaction rolled back
            deactivate DB

            Note right of Store: Return state conflict

        else Write-Off is Pending

            %% ==========================================
            %% 7. PROCESS ADMINISTRATOR DECISION
            %% ==========================================

            alt Administrator selects Reject

                %% ==========================================
                %% 8. VALIDATE REJECTION REASON
                %% ==========================================

                alt Rejection reason is missing

                    Store->>+DB: ROLLBACK
                    DB-->>Store: Transaction rolled back
                    deactivate DB

                    Note right of Store: Return validation error

                else Rejection reason is valid

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 9. REJECT WRITE-OFF
                    %% ==========================================

                    Store->>+DB: UPDATE WriteOff Status = Rejected

                    DB-->>Store: Write-Off marked Rejected
                    deactivate DB

                    Store->>+DB: INSERT AuditLog and COMMIT

                    DB-->>Store: Rejection committed
                    deactivate DB

                    Note right of Store: Physical and Reserved Stock unchanged

                end

            else Administrator selects Approve

                %% ==========================================
                %% 10. LOAD WRITE-OFF ITEMS AND EVIDENCE
                %% ==========================================

                Store->>+DB: SELECT WriteOffItems and WriteOffAttachments

                DB-->>Store: Requested quantities and evidence references
                deactivate DB

                %% ==========================================
                %% 11. VALIDATE REQUIRED INFORMATION
                %% ==========================================

                alt Missing evidence or disposal method

                    Store->>+DB: ROLLBACK

                    DB-->>Store: Transaction rolled back
                    deactivate DB

                    Note right of Store: Return validation error

                else Required information is valid

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 12. LOCK AFFECTED INVENTORY ROWS
                    %% ==========================================

                    loop For each WriteOffItem

                        Store->>+DB: SELECT InventoryBalance FOR UPDATE

                        DB-->>Store: Physical and Reserved quantities
                        deactivate DB

                        Store->>+DB: SELECT active Reservations and InventoryLocks

                        DB-->>Store: Reservation and lock information
                        deactivate DB

                        Note right of Store: Validate quantity and unresolved reserved overlap

                    end

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 13. VALIDATE ALL WRITE-OFF ITEMS
                    %% ==========================================

                    alt Any item exceeds unreserved stock or overlaps unresolved reservation

                        Store->>+DB: ROLLBACK

                        DB-->>Store: Transaction rolled back
                        deactivate DB

                        Note right of Store: Reject entire approval

                        Note right of Store: No inventory deduction is committed

                    else All WriteOffItems are eligible

                        %% ==========================================
                        %% 14. PROCESS APPROVED ITEMS
                        %% ==========================================

                        loop For each approved WriteOffItem

                            %% ==========================================
                            %% 15. DEDUCT PHYSICAL STOCK
                            %% ==========================================

                            Store->>+DB: UPDATE InventoryBalance PhysicalQuantity

                            Note right of DB: Deduct approved quantity and recalculate Available

                            DB-->>Store: InventoryBalance updated
                            deactivate DB

                            %% ==========================================
                            %% 16. RESOLVE MATCHING INVENTORY LOCK
                            %% ==========================================

                            opt Item has matching active InventoryLock

                                Store->>+DB: UPDATE matching InventoryLock records

                                Note right of DB: Resolve only the written-off locked quantity

                                DB-->>Store: Matching lock state updated
                                deactivate DB

                            end

                            %% ==========================================
                            %% 17. INVALIDATE AFFECTED QR LABELS
                            %% ==========================================

                            Store->>+DB: UPDATE affected BatchQrLabel status

                            DB-->>Store: QR labels invalidated as applicable
                            deactivate DB

                            %% ==========================================
                            %% 18. APPEND INVENTORY TRANSACTION
                            %% ==========================================

                            Store->>+DB: INSERT InventoryTransaction for WriteOffItem

                            Note right of DB: Unique source reference prevents duplicate deduction

                            DB-->>Store: Inventory movement recorded
                            deactivate DB

                        end

                        %% ==========================================
                        %% 19. APPROVE WRITE-OFF
                        %% ==========================================

                        Store->>+DB: UPDATE WriteOff Status = Approved

                        DB-->>Store: Write-Off marked Approved
                        deactivate DB

                        %% ==========================================
                        %% 20. AUDIT AND COMMIT
                        %% ==========================================

                        Store->>+DB: INSERT AuditLog and COMMIT

                        DB-->>Store: Approval transaction committed
                        deactivate DB

                        Note right of Store: All inventory movements committed exactly once

                    end

                end

            end

        end

        %% ==========================================
        %% 21. RETURN TRANSACTION RESULT
        %% ==========================================

        Store-->>Service: Write-Off Decision Result
        deactivate Store

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 22. RETURN APPROVAL RESPONSE
    %% ==========================================

    Service-->>API: Approval outcome or business error
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: Decision response
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Admin: Display Approved, Rejected or Error
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% BUSINESS CONSTRAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Service,DB: Only Administrator may approve or reject Write-Off

    Note over Store,DB: Approval and all stock movements form one atomic transaction

    Note over Store,DB: Pending approval alone must not deduct Physical Stock

    Note over Store,DB: Reserved quantities must be resolved before write-off

    Note over Store,DB: Repeated approval must never deduct stock twice

    Note over Store,DB: Rejection does not modify inventory balances